#: src/strings.ts:2222
msgid ""
"Force push:\n"
"Use this if changes made on this device are not appearing on other devices. This will overwrite the data on the server with the data from this device.\n"
"\n"
"Force pull:\n"
"Use this if changes from other devices are not appearing on this device. This will overwrite the data on this device with the latest data from the server.\n"
"\n"
"**These must only be used for troubleshooting. Using them regularly for sync is not recommended and will lead to unexpected data loss and other issues. If you are having persistent issues with sync, please report them to us at support@streetwriters.co.**"
msgstr ""
"Force push:\n"
"Use this if changes made on this device are not appearing on other devices. This will overwrite the data on the server with the data from this device.\n"
"\n"
"Force pull:\n"
"Use this if changes from other devices are not appearing on this device. This will overwrite the data on this device with the latest data from the server.\n"
"\n"
"**These must only be used for troubleshooting. Using them regularly for sync is not recommended and will lead to unexpected data loss and other issues. If you are having persistent issues with sync, please report them to us at support@streetwriters.co.**Envoi forcé :\n"
"Utilisez cette option si les modifications effectuées sur cet appareil n'apparaissent pas sur les autres. Les données du serveur seront remplacées par celles de cet appareil.\n"
"\n"
"Récupération forcée :\n"
"Utilisez cette option si les modifications provenant d'autres appareils n'apparaissent pas sur celui-ci. Les données de cet appareil seront remplacées par les données les plus récentes du serveur.\n"
"\n"
"**Ces options ne doivent servir qu'au dépannage. Les utiliser régulièrement pour la synchronisation est déconseillé et entraînera des pertes de données inattendues et d'autres problèmes. Si vous rencontrez des problèmes persistants de synchronisation, signalez-les-nous à support@streetwriters.co.**"

